        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our growth strategy and our business could be adversely affected if we are not able to continue to operate in existing geographies, successfully expand into new geographies or maintain or establish new relationships with physician partners.",
