        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Presently, we manage one IPA located in Los Angeles, California with over 230 primary care physicians (\"PCPs\"), 2,800 specialists and ancillary providers and an enrollment of approximately 32,750 patients.",
